.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:490:- **Spec:** [DOS-301](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-301). Redesigned: sync DB projection inside transaction with shared validators; sync-best-effort file projection POST-DB-commit (no job queue); per-rule SAVEPOINT failure isolation; `claim_projection_status` table; repair command.
