.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:519:- **Spec:** [DOS-300](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-300). Per ADR-0125.
.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:520:- **Files owned:** `temporal_scope` + `sensitivity` columns on `intelligence_claims`, `CLAIM_TYPE_REGISTRY` enum + exhaustiveness check, schema migration.
.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:531:- CI invariants now active: `commit_claim` is the only writer to `intelligence_claims`; `record_corroboration` / `reconcile_contradiction` only writers to corroboration/contradiction tables; no `DELETE FROM` claim tables anywhere; immutability allowlist enforced; `services/derived_state.rs` is the only writer to legacy AI surfaces; hard-delete CHAIN refactored
.docs/plans/v1.4.0-waves.md:542:- **Spec:** [DOS-5](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-5) + [DOS-326](https://linear.app/a8c/issue/DOS-326). 5 canonical factors per ADR-0114 R1.4 + `subject_fit_confidence` composer-local helper. `unknown_timestamp_penalty` folds into `freshness_weight` via `FreshnessContext { timestamp_known: bool }`. **DOS-326:** retire standalone `intelligence/contamination.rs` guard; fold cross-entity-coherence into Trust Compiler as one factor (not a separate gate).
