.docs/decisions/0043-meeting-intelligence-is-core.md:9:ADR-0026 drew the core/extension boundary with meeting prep, portfolio attention, and stakeholder context on the extension side (CS extension). But the CLI skills inventory reveals these are universal needs, not CS-specific ones:
