.docs/decisions/0036-inbox-processing-in-phase-1.md:11:1. The processor pipeline (classifier, router, enrichment hooks) shared infrastructure with governance logic (ADR-0025)
.docs/decisions/0036-inbox-processing-in-phase-1.md:19:Inbox processing is part of Phase 1. ADR-0015's deferral no longer applies.
