.docs/decisions/0034-adaptive-dashboard.md:21:- Revisit when post-meeting capture (ADR-0023) ships, since that's when "between meetings" becomes critical
.docs/decisions/0064-meeting-prep-page-redesign.md:1:# ADR-0064: Meeting Prep Page Redesign — Briefing-First, Agenda-Anchored
.docs/decisions/0064-meeting-prep-page-redesign.md:6:**Relates to:** ADR-0062 (Briefing Artifacts vs Live Queries), ADR-0057 (Entity Intelligence)
.docs/decisions/0064-meeting-prep-page-redesign.md:151:### Editability (Future — Not This ADR)
.docs/decisions/0064-meeting-prep-page-redesign.md:153:This ADR acknowledges but defers user editability:
.docs/decisions/0064-meeting-prep-page-redesign.md:154:- **User-authored agenda/notes**: Requires a `user_notes` or `user_agenda` field on the meeting that survives re-enrichment. This is a separate data model decision.
