| End of W4 | performance-engineer | Trust compiler math at claim-volume; freshness fallback hot path | Trust score p99 < 5ms (provisional) |
| End of W5 | performance-engineer | Pilot abilities vs legacy capability latency | No regression vs legacy p50/p99 |
| End of W6 | full re-run | Burst signal storms; coalescing bounds; release gate latency budget | Per provisional budgets above |

**Pass rule:** budgets locked at end of W1 baseline run; no regression in subsequent waves. Budget changes require L6 approval.

### Suite E — Edge cases

| Gate | Owner | Coverage |
|---|---|---|
| Continuous (per PR) | qa-expert + harness | Property tests on: timestamp parsing (DOS-308), sorted-lock ordering (DOS-310), trust math (DOS-5), freshness fallback (DOS-299), immutability allowlist (DOS-7 amendment D), tombstone PRE-GATE round-trip, write-path ordering invariant. Fuzz on: JSON validators, prompt fingerprint hashing |
| End of W3 | qa-expert + harness | Bundles 1+5 against substrate |
| W4–W6 | qa-expert + harness | Bundles 1+5 mandatory; bundles 2-4, 6-8 tracked-but-not-blocking per Adversarial Edge Case Catalogue |

**Pass rule:** bundles 1+5 must pass at W6. Property tests must be green continuously. Bundles 2-4, 6-8 failures filed as v1.4.1 follow-ups but do not block ship unless they expose a substrate bug.

## CI-enforced architecture invariants

These run continuously, not just at gates. Architecture is enforced structurally so reviewers catch *new* drift, not the same drift each wave.

| Invariant | Mechanism | Required by wave |
|---|---|---|
| Services-only mutations (no direct DB writes from commands) | clippy lint + grep CI test | W2 |
| No `Utc::now()` or `thread_rng()` in `services/` or `abilities/` | clippy lint | W2 |
| `commit_claim` is the only writer to `intelligence_claims` | grep CI test | W3 |
| `record_corroboration` / `reconcile_contradiction` are the only writers to `claim_corroborations` / `claim_contradictions` | grep CI test | W3 |
| No `DELETE FROM intelligence_claims \| claim_corroborations \| claim_contradictions` anywhere | grep CI test | W3 |
| Immutability allowlist on `intelligence_claims` columns (DOS-7 amendment D) | trybuild + clippy | W3 |
| `intelligence.json` writes only via universal fence (DOS-311) | grep CI test | W1 |
| No customer-domain strings in source/fixtures (real `*.com`, real names) | regex CI test | W0 |
| Intelligence Loop 5-question check on PRs touching schema | PR template checklist + CI bot comment | W2 |
| No `claim_type` with Global subject (spine restriction) | trybuild compile-time | W1 |
| `services/derived_state.rs` is the only writer to legacy AI surfaces post-W3 | grep CI test | W3 |
| Hard-delete CHAIN refactored — no bare DELETE on `account_stakeholder_roles` outside service | grep CI test | W3 |

